{"blocks":[{"type":"paragraph","text":"広島上陸っ＼(^O^)／☆"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"久々の広島駅いえあ。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"久々の広島の街いえあ。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"ひ、久々の...。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"うおおおおーっ!"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"今日はさゆにゃん(井上小百合chan)とるんるん(斎藤ちはるchan)と"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"３人席で新幹線で揺られ、ちま(樋口日奈chan)とまあや(和田まあやchan)と３人部屋で寝ます!"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"にしても。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"やっぱ広島-東京間て遠いのね。新幹線で４時間とか長いよー(д)"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"よー通ったなぁ自分。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"よー通わせてくれたなぁぱぱまま。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"とかゆーて、みんなで帰ってた頃の思い出にひとりで浸りながら"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"帰ってきました(*^^*)"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"明日は初の広島ライブ!"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"ほんまにほんまに頑張りますっ"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"たくさんの広島の人に乃木坂のこと好きになってほしいから。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"お天気悪いかもらしいから、気をつけて来てね(>_<)"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/himeka.nakamoto/img/blog/photos/entry/2012/06/09/6996635/0000.gif","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"ウニホーレンって広島な居酒屋でメジャーなの?"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"うにほーれーん?"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"地元民はおうちで夜ご飯食べるから、"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"居酒屋さんとかあんま詳しくないのよ('・・`)"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/himeka.nakamoto/img/blog/photos/entry/2012/06/09/6996635/0001.gif","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"よく使う広島弁は何ですか?"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"たいぎーいっ"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"〜せんにゃいけーんっ"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"↑よく真似される(^ω^)"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/himeka.nakamoto/img/blog/photos/entry/2012/06/09/6996635/0002.gif","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"ひめたんが東京の学校に入学してから"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"広島の学校と違うなあって思ったところってある?(・ω・)"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"中学校までに習った範囲が東京のがちょっと広かったり..."},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"あと、東京は学校の敷地面積が狭いから校舎が縦に長い!"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"それから、グランドが砂じゃなーい(`・ω・')"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/himeka.nakamoto/img/blog/photos/entry/2012/06/09/6996635/0003.gif","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"広島出身の有吉、アンガールズはどうですか?"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"勝手に親近感(^^)"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"広島出身の有名人の方たちが活躍されてると、"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"「ひめたんはあの人たちと広島弁でわかりあえるんじゃないか」って"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"勝手に思う。勝手に..."},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/himeka.nakamoto/img/blog/photos/entry/2012/06/09/6996635/0003.gif","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"比治山学園って知ってますか?"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"知ってる!"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"中３の時に比治山から中学校に学園案内みたいなの来てましたよー"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"ひめたんの友達も何人かいるし(^O^)!"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/himeka.nakamoto/img/blog/photos/entry/2012/06/09/6996635/0004.gif","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"大和ミュージアム行ったらことあるんだけど日芽香ちゃんは知ってる?"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"知ってる!車でみんなで行ったことあるよー"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"フロアいっぱいに広がる船の模型があるのよ確か。あれが印象的(^^)"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/himeka.nakamoto/img/blog/photos/entry/2012/06/09/6996635/0005.gif","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"お好み焼きは上手く作れますか?"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"上手くゆーて、ひっくり返す時によくぐしゃーってなるけれどもー"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"んでもひめたんお手製お好み焼き、美味しいと思うよ∩^ω^∩"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/himeka.nakamoto/img/blog/photos/entry/2012/06/09/6996635/0005.gif","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"「これって広島だけなんじゃ!!知らんかった!!」ってびっくりしたこと、"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"なんかありますか??"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"毎年8月6日は登校日なの。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"こっちの人はみんな普通に夏休みなのね...。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/himeka.nakamoto/img/blog/photos/entry/2012/06/09/6996635/0005.gif","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"広島観光したいんだけど、おすすめガイドして!!"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"原爆ドームで悲しい歴史を学ぶのもアリだと思うし"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"宮島でもみじやら鳥居やらを堪能するのも素敵だよねー"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"お好み焼き食べて、ちょっと重たいけどもみじまんじゅうをお土産にね。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"んーいいじゃーん☆"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/himeka.nakamoto/img/blog/photos/entry/2012/06/09/6996635/0005.gif","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"最近知ったんじゃけど、はしまきって広島限定なんだってね〜"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"まじ???"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"ほえー今知ったー!"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"はしまきって去年はじめてたべたけど、ありゃ美味しいのよね(*^^*)"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"東京の人も食べるべきっ"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/himeka.nakamoto/img/blog/photos/entry/2012/06/09/6996635/0006.gif","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"ずっと東京にいたら広島弁忘れるとちゃいますか?"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"自分だいぶ標準語になってきたつもりでおったんじゃけどね"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"こっちの人からしたらまだまだ訛ってるそうな←"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"しゃべる上で発生する微妙なうねうね感が抜けるまでは、"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"なかなか時間がかかるみたいね('・・`)"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/himeka.nakamoto/img/blog/photos/entry/2012/06/09/6996635/0006.gif","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"広島弁って変換しても上手く漢字になりませんよね?"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"あーわかるーわかるよ!"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"例えば「持っとらん」ってうとうとしても「持っと」って一発で出てこないの。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"なんでーみんな持っとらんって言うでしょー"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"いや言うしかだよ(`・ω・')おこっ"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/himeka.nakamoto/img/blog/photos/entry/2012/06/09/6996635/0007.gif","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"学校とかで広島弁いじられたことある?"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"それでも、学校だと標準語しか使わない?"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"学校では広島弁を封印しようとしたのね?"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"んでも入学初日で諦めたってゆーね。だって無理よ(д)"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"(*´・ω・*)ひめたん"}],"source":"archive"}